<title>USA: MIM Corp FY 96 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>MIM Corp FY 96 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER, N.Y. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Years Ended</p>
<p>				  December 31</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenues				     $283,159	$213,929</p>
<p>Income (loss) before non cash</p>
<p>  stock option charge			(6,528)	 (7,517)</p>
<p> Non cash stock option charge	   (26,640)	     ---</p>
<p> Net loss				     (31,754)	 (6,772)</p>
<p> Net loss per share			   (3.32)	  (1.43)</p>
<p> Weighted shares outstanding		 9,557	   4,732</p>
<p> Fully diluted shares outstanding	 16,164</p>
<p>				   In Thousands</p>
<p>			  (Except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net for fiscal 1996 included a non-recurring, non-cash charge of $26.6 million for costs associated with a one-time executive stock option issuance in conjunction with the company's initial public offering.</p>
